<%# One option of a choice the shop limits — the textile, the way the order
    comes back: a tile with its title and a line under it, greyed out when the
    shop does not offer it. The content under the title comes from the block.
    Locals: form, field, value, title, available. %>
<label class="flex cursor-pointer flex-col gap-1 rounded-xs border border-line p-3
              has-[:checked]:border-emulsion has-[:checked]:bg-emulsion/5
              has-[:disabled]:cursor-not-allowed has-[:disabled]:opacity-50">
  <%= form.radio_button field, value, class: "sr-only", disabled: !available %>
  <span class="font-display text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.04em]"><%= title %></span>
  <%= yield %>
</label>
